Tips : If you ever get lost do "cd" to get back to your home directory !
%
Tips : Use $TMPDIR instead of $TMP, $TMP is non standard and comes from MS-DOS :D
%
Tips : Use ": > file" to quickly clear a file !
%
Tips : Stanix has an extention of "ttyname" called "fdname".
It Allow you to get the path to any file descriptor :D
%
Tips : In GUI the program stanix-version allow you to see your current version of Stanix!
%
Tips : You can mount your own tmpfs anywhere using "mount -t tmpfs -S /dev/null -T /my-tmpfs,
note that this require root permissions.
%
The name Stanix comes from the contraction of Stanislas's Unix, Stanislas being my real name!
